Step 1 Summary: "I established a secure, isolated local development 
                environment and implemented basic LLM client authentication 
                using environment variables to safely connect my application 
                to the Gemini API."

Step 2 Summary: "I built a custom text processing module using a sliding 
                 window algorithm to slice raw documents into overlapping 
                 chunks, preventing context loss at the chunk boundaries."

Step 3 Summary: "I integrated a text-embedding model API to convert 
                unstructured text data into high-dimensional numerical 
                vectors, enabling semantic similarity calculations."

Step 4 Summary: "I implemented a mathematical retrieval system using 
                 Cosine Similarity to compare high-dimensional vectors, 
                 enabling the system to identify the most semantically 
                 relevant document chunks."

Step 5 Summary: "I engineered a prompt grounding mechanism that dynamically 
                 injects vector search results into the LLM's context window,
                 successfully constraining the model to prevent 
                 hallucinations."

Step 6 Summary: "I built an automated evaluation harness to quantitatively 
                 measure the retrieval hit rate of my vector search engine 
                 against a golden dataset, proving its accuracy."